{"3571940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Demon of the time", "steam_appid": 3571940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>⚔️ ANCIENT JAPAN. FUTURE WEAPONS. THE DEMON OF TIME.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The cultists of the Demon of Time have obtained weapons from the future and turned ancient Japan into a battlefield where the past, present, and future collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Become a warrior monk and embark on a dangerous journey through ancient temples, bamboo forests, abandoned villages, and cursed lands to stop the growing chaos and save the world from destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571940/extras/cff9cc808490f4a0a82b28579f667197.avif?t=1783485985\" width=600 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>🔥 FAST-PACED AND SPECTACULAR FPS ACTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight through hordes of enemies using a powerful arsenal of modern weapons brought into the past through a distortion of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔫 Pistols</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥 Shotguns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ Assault Rifles and Machine Guns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚀 Rocket Launchers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover powerful combat boosts, including speed boosts, protective shields, and infinite ammo to survive even the deadliest battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571940/extras/c8d9678db30e7670a8b63b988fe99115.avif?t=1783485985\" width=600 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>👹 DANGEROUS ENEMIES AND POWERFUL BOSSES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Face fanatical cultists, demonic samurai, and other creatures twisted by the power of the Demon of Time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The most dangerous enemies guard the ancient altar. Defeat the mighty guardians Gekko and Raijin to reach the final battle and stop the collapse of time itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>🏺 COLLECT SACRED ARTIFACTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The only way to seal the Demon of Time once again is to find five ancient artifacts hidden near his temple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore the world, complete optional challenges, and uncover its deepest secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571940/extras/83d3d498935ec663a5bd7702b1b9b2c9.avif?t=1783485985\" width=600 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">🎮 GAME FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Fast-paced FPS gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Atmospheric ancient Japanese setting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Modern weapons in a world of the past</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Diverse enemies and epic boss fights</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Artifact and secret hunting system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Additional challenges and missions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ 6 unique levels to explore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Are you ready to challenge time itself?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 